; ECLIPSE — LOCAL SECRETS TEMPLATE
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; 1. COPY this file in the same folder and rename the copy to:  UserSecrets.ini
; 2. Put your real values in the copy.
; 3. UserSecrets.ini is gitignored and MUST NEVER be committed or pushed.
;
; This is the convenience fallback for the ElevenLabs key (GDD 16.12). The code
; prefers the environment variable ELEVENLABS_API_KEY if it is set; this file is
; only read when the env var is empty. Either way the key never lives in source
; or in git.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

[ElevenLabs]
ApiKey=PUT_YOUR_ELEVENLABS_KEY_HERE
